<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches played in the German first division on Friday:</p>
<p> Fortuna Duesseldorf	 0  VfB Stuttgart	   4</p>
<p> Werder Bremen		 0  Duisburg		  2</p>
<p>Playing on Saturday:</p>
<p> Borussia Dortmund	   v  Borussia Moenchengladbach</p>
<p> Hamburg			 v  Bochum</p>
<p> Cologne			 v  St. Pauli</p>
<p> 1860 Munich		   v  Hansa Rostock</p>
<p> Schalke			 v  Arminia Bielefeld</p>
